    "en": "Ambulocetus natans in an illustrative resting crouch, informed by its incomplete skeleton and published interpretations. The upper snout, tail, soft tissues, webbing and posture are reconstructed; approximate scale and high, somewhat lateral eyes do not establish a precise gaze angle or proven terrestrial gait.",
